  "comments": "<p>Mintmasters' initials are featured on the coin reverse. These initials are not included on coins minted after 2007. There was a short period in 2001 when there was no acting director for the mint. A small part of this year's mintage features a star to the right of the former director's initials.<br><br><i>Reverse</i><br>Two main groups are known:<br>Die <strong>A</strong> - \"1\" in denomination thick, vertical line in 'K\" short, one cut in left top leaf.<br>Die <strong>B</strong> - all details enhanced, \"1\" in denomination thin, vertical line in 'K\" tall, two deep cuts in in left top leaf.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/619569336b5e2.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/619569336b5e2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>© Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev<br><br><i>Combinations</i><br><strong>A</strong>: 1997-1999.<br><strong>B</strong>: 2000-2012, 2015, 2016.</p>",
